1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,040
Why does the universe

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,390
feel like something...

3
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:06,830
from the inside?

4
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,620
For billions of years, there was

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,880
only matter, moving in the dark.

6
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:15,760
Dust, gathering into stars.

7
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:19,070
Nothing, as far as we know, was felt.

8
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:22,450
And then, somewhere,

9
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:24,450
something began to notice.

10
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,370
Look closely at a brain, and

11
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,960
you will find no feelings.

12
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:32,460
Only cells.

13
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:37,000
Eighty-six billion neurons, each one

14
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:38,900
reaching out to thousands of others.

15
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,480
Tiny pulses of electricity

16
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,040
race along their branches.

17
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,000
Chemicals drift across

18
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,170
the gaps between them.

19
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:50,170
There is nothing here but physics.

20
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:53,790
Atoms, many of them forged in stars,

21
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:56,580
obeying the same laws as everything else.

22
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:02,080
And yet, from this electrical storm,

23
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:04,430
something extraordinary appears.

24
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:07,240
Three pounds of matter that sees the

25
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:09,760
color of the sky, that tastes the

26
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:12,690
sea, that remembers a voice it loved.

27
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:17,760
Inside, there is a world.

28
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,080
What you see is not the world

29
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,640
itself, but a model, built in

30
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:25,790
darkness, inside the skull.

31
00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:28,170
Light becomes signals.

32
00:01:28,730 --> 00:01:30,110
Signals become color,

33
00:01:30,410 --> 00:01:32,240
and depth, and a face.

34
00:01:34,220 --> 00:01:36,440
Memories are not stored like photographs.

35
00:01:37,190 --> 00:01:39,340
Each time you remember, you rebuild

36
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:41,310
the moment, a little differently.

37
00:01:43,250 --> 00:01:45,040
Every thought you have ever had was

38
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:48,080
a pattern, rising, and fading away.

39
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:52,550
But here is the mystery.

40
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:56,870
We can trace every signal, map

41
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,890
every pathway, measure every spike.

42
00:02:00,730 --> 00:02:02,920
And yet, nowhere in that map

43
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,820
do we find the blue of the sky,

44
00:02:05,270 --> 00:02:06,920
or the feeling of being you.

45
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,510
Philosophers call this the

46
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:12,410
hard problem of consciousness.

47
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:14,140
How does electrical

48
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:16,020
activity become experience?

49
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,900
Why doesn't all of this

50
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:19,380
simply happen in the dark?

51
00:02:22,610 --> 00:02:24,320
Some think awareness emerges

52
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,680
when information is woven

53
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,540
together in just the right way.

54
00:02:28,540 --> 00:02:30,490
Others suspect it is something deeper,

55
00:02:31,020 --> 00:02:32,980
a property of the universe itself.

56
00:02:34,940 --> 00:02:35,830
No one knows.

57
00:02:37,620 --> 00:02:39,000
What we do know is that

58
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,910
awareness never stands still.

59
00:02:41,650 --> 00:02:44,740
It forms, dissolves, and forms again.

60
00:02:45,750 --> 00:02:47,690
Much of the matter in you is replaced,

61
00:02:48,130 --> 00:02:50,790
and yet, somehow, you remain.

62
00:02:53,930 --> 00:02:55,020
Perhaps you are not a thing

63
00:02:55,060 --> 00:02:56,770
at all, but a process.

64
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,190
A pattern the universe is running.

65
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:03,300
So ask yourself, one more time.

66
00:03:05,190 --> 00:03:06,340
Is consciousness something

67
00:03:06,420 --> 00:03:07,620
the universe created?

68
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,300
Or is it a way for the

69
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:11,540
universe to experience itself?
